<style>
  :root{--blue:#023059;--blue-light:#034a8a;--orange:#B95E05;--orange-dark:#9a4e04;--orange-glow:rgba(185,94,5,.08);--border:#e2e5ea;--text:#1e293b;--text-mid:#475569;--text-muted:#94a3b8;--bg:#f1f4f8;--card:#ffffff;--good:#16a34a;--good-bg:rgba(22,163,74,.06);--warn:#d97706;--warn-bg:rgba(217,119,6,.06);--bad:#dc2626;--radius:16px;--radius-sm:10px;--shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(2,48,89,.06),0 4px 14px rgba(2,48,89,.04);--shadow-lg:0 4px 20px rgba(2,48,89,.08)}
  .oo-tool *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  .oo-tool{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;padding:28px 0 60px}

  /* ── METHOD SELECTOR ── */
  .method-sel-wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto 24px;padding:0 16px}
  .method-sel-card{background:#f7fbff;border:1px solid rgba(2,48,89,.12);border-radius:18px;padding:20px;text-align:center}
  .method-sel-card h2{color:var(--blue);font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;line-height:1.15}
  .method-sel-card>p{color:var(--text-mid);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .method-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:stretch}
  @media(max-width:639px){.method-options{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .method-opt{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:18px;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;min-height:100%}
  .method-opt--primary{border:3px solid var(--orange);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(185,94,5,.08)}
  .method-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;width:100%;min-height:36px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;padding:0 16px;margin-bottom:2px}
  .method-badge--recommended{background:#f4ebe2;color:var(--orange);border:1px solid rgba(185,94,5,.22)}
  .method-badge--manual{background:#eef3f8;color:#6f869f;border:1px solid #d7e1eb}
  .method-title-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .method-opt-icon{font-size:28px;line-height:1;flex:0 0 auto}
  .method-opt h3{color:var(--blue);font-size:18px;font-weight:800;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;line-height:1.2}
  .method-opt>p{color:var(--text-mid);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
  .method-opt ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
  .method-opt ul li{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-mid)}
  .method-opt-spacer{margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px}
  .method-btn-orange,.method-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;min-height:54px;border-radius:999px;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;transition:all .15s}
  .method-btn-orange{background:var(--orange);color:#fff;border:none;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(185,94,5,.28)}
  .method-btn-orange:hover{background:var(--orange-dark)}
  .method-btn-outline{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:3px solid var(--blue)}
  .method-btn-outline:hover{background:#f8fbfe;color:var(--blue)}
  @media(max-width:768px){
    .method-sel-card{padding:16px}
    .method-sel-card h2{font-size:22px}
    .method-options{gap:14px}
    .method-opt{padding:16px}
    .method-opt-icon{font-size:26px}
    .method-btn-orange,.method-btn-outline{min-height:50px;font-size:17px}
  }

  /* ── MAIN TOOL ── */
  .container{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}
  .section-tabs{display:flex;gap:0;margin:0 0 0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border)}
  .section-tab{appearance:none;border:none;background:none;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-muted);cursor:pointer;position:relative;transition:color .2s}
  .section-tab:hover{color:var(--text-mid)}.section-tab.active{color:var(--blue)}
  .section-tab.active::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-2px;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--orange);border-radius:3px 3px 0 0}
  .section-tab .tab-num{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-right:6px;background:var(--border);color:var(--text-muted);transition:all .2s}
  .section-tab.active .tab-num{background:var(--orange);color:#fff}
  .tab-panel{display:none;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:40px}.tab-panel.active{display:block}
  .measure-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;margin-bottom:24px}
  .m-step{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;overflow:hidden}
  @media(max-width:760px){.m-step{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .m-step .illus{background:#eef2f7;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;min-height:200px}
  .m-step .body{padding:20px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
  .measure-num{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0}
  .m-step h3{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .m-step .desc{font-size:15px;color:var(--text-mid);line-height:1.55}
  .inline-input{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .inline-input label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}
  .num-input{width:90px;padding:8px 10px;border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);text-align:center;transition:border-color .15s;outline:none}
  .num-input:focus{border-color:var(--orange)}.num-input.filled{border-color:var(--good);background:rgba(22,163,74,.03)}
  .unit-label{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:600}
  .unit-flip{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8f9fb;color:var(--text-mid);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
  .unit-flip:hover{border-color:var(--orange);color:var(--orange)}
  .input-check{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--good);color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s}
  .input-check.show{opacity:1}
  .go-btn-wrap{text-align:center;margin-top:28px}
  .go-btn{appearance:none;border:none;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;padding:14px 36px;border-radius:999px;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(185,94,5,.25);transition:all .2s}
  .go-btn:hover{background:var(--orange-dark);transform:translateY(-1px)}.go-btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default;transform:none}
  .go-status{margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted)}
  .fit-tool{display:grid;grid-template-columns:340px 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:start}
  @media(max-width:860px){.fit-tool{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .slider-panel{position:sticky;top:20px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:24px}
  @media(max-width:860px){.slider-panel{position:static}}
  .slider-panel h2{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:4px}
  .slider-panel .sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:18px}
  .input-group{margin-bottom:18px}
  .input-group label{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px;gap:0}
  .input-group label .step-ltr{color:var(--orange);font-weight:800;margin-right:4px}
  .input-group label .step-hint{font-weight:400;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:12px;margin-left:4px}
  .input-group output{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:var(--orange);min-width:42px;text-align:right;margin-left:auto}
  .u-val{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-left:2px;align-self:center}
  .nose-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .nose-row label{margin-bottom:0!important;white-space:nowrap}
  .input-group .range-bounds{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px}
  input[type="range"]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#e2e5ea;outline:none;cursor:pointer}
  input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:32px;height:24px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--orange);border:3px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s}
  input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover{transform:scale(1.1)}
  input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb{width:32px;height:24px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--orange);border:3px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2);cursor:pointer}
  .slider-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
  .btn-primary{appearance:none;border:none;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--orange-dark)}
  .btn-secondary{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff;color:var(--text-mid);padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
  .btn-secondary:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}
  .head-note{background:#f8f9fb;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-mid);line-height:1.5;margin-top:4px}
  .head-note strong{color:var(--blue)}
  .results-area h2{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:4px}
  .results-area .sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:16px}
  .results-msg{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-mid);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .results-msg strong{color:var(--text)}
  .results-msg.msg-warn{border-color:rgba(217,119,6,.3);background:var(--warn-bg)}
  .results-msg.msg-good{border-color:rgba(22,163,74,.3);background:var(--good-bg)}
  .results-msg.msg-head{border-left:4px solid var(--orange)}
  .mask-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}
  @media(max-width:640px){.mask-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .mask-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:box-shadow .2s,transform .2s}
  .mask-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .mask-card.best{border-color:rgba(22,163,74,.35)}
  .mask-card .card-img-wrap{background:#f4f6f9;padding:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:220px}
  .mask-card .card-img-wrap img{max-width:100%;max-height:260px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px}
  .mask-card .card-body{padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex:1}
  .mask-title{font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue)}
  .mask-cat{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);font-style:italic;margin-top:-6px}
  .tag{display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3px}
  .tag-best{background:rgba(22,163,74,.1);color:var(--good)}.tag-good{background:rgba(22,163,74,.08);color:var(--good)}
  .tag-close{background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);color:var(--warn)}.tag-close-match{background:#fef9e7;color:#b45309;border:1px solid rgba(180,83,9,.2)}
  .tag-head{background:var(--orange-glow);color:var(--orange);border:1px solid rgba(185,94,5,.2)}
  .tag-stretch{background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e}.tag-nose-warn{background:#fef2f2;color:var(--bad)}
  .tags-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.fit-detail{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-mid);line-height:1.5}
  .range-mini{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}
  .range-mini th,.range-mini td{padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #f0f0f4;text-align:center}
  .range-mini th{background:#f8f9fb;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);font-size:11px}
  .range-mini td.in-range{color:var(--good);font-weight:700}.range-mini td.out-range{color:var(--warn);font-weight:700}
  .mask-specs{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:13px}.spec-label{color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:600}
  .spec-badge{display:inline-block;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:999px;padding:1px 7px;font-size:11px;margin-right:4px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text-mid)}
  .spec-badge:hover{background:var(--orange-glow);border-color:var(--orange);color:var(--orange)}
  .cta-row{margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px}
  .btn-product{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;transition:background .15s}
  .btn-product:hover{background:var(--orange-dark)}
  .ask-pro-bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:20px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--card);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm)}
  .ask-pro-bar .label{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-mid)}
  .btn-outline{appearance:none;background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid rgba(2,48,89,.3);padding:7px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:all .15s}
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--blue);background:rgba(2,48,89,.04)}
  .empty-results{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:var(--text-muted);grid-column:1/-1}.empty-results .icon{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .nose-options{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .nose-opt{appearance:none;border:2px solid var(--border);background:#fff;color:var(--text-mid);padding:7px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
  .nose-opt:hover{border-color:var(--orange);color:var(--orange)}
  .nose-opt.active{border-color:var(--orange);background:var(--orange-glow);color:var(--orange)}
  .nose-opt-check{display:inline-block;margin-left:4px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .15s}.nose-opt.active .nose-opt-check{opacity:1}
</style>

<div class="oo-tool">

  <!-- ── SECTION 1: METHOD SELECTOR ── -->
  <div class="method-sel-wrap">
    <div class="method-sel-card">
      <h2>How would you like to find your mask fit?</h2>
      <p>Choose automatic camera measuring or follow the manual ruler guide below</p>
      <div class="method-options">

        <!-- Camera option -->
        <div class="method-opt method-opt--primary">
          <span class="method-badge method-badge--recommended">Recommended</span>
          <div class="method-title-row">
            <div class="method-opt-icon">🎥</div>
            <h3>Auto Camera Measuring</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Point your front camera at your face. Our tool measures you automatically in seconds, with no ruler needed.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>✓ Takes about 30 seconds</li>
            <li>✓ Works on phone or desktop</li>
            <li>✓ Get instant mask recommendations</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="method-opt-spacer">
            <a id="oo-camera-btn" href="https://facefit.oceansoptics.com/face-fit" class="method-btn-orange">
              Start Camera Measuring →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Manual option -->
        <div class="method-opt">
          <span class="method-badge method-badge--manual">Measure Yourself</span>
          <div class="method-title-row">
            <div class="method-opt-icon">📐</div>
            <h3>Manual Ruler Guide</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Prefer to measure yourself with a ruler or tape? Follow our step-by-step guide below.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>✓ No camera needed</li>
            <li>✓ Works anywhere</li>
            <li>✓ Fine-tune with sliders</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="method-opt-spacer">
            <button class="method-btn-outline" onclick="document.getElementById('oo-tool-tabs').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})">
              Use Ruler Guide ↓
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── SECTION 2: TABS ── -->
  <div class="container" id="oo-tool-tabs">
    <div class="section-tabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="section-tab active" data-tab="measure" role="tab"><span class="tab-num">1</span> How to Measure</button>
      <button class="section-tab" data-tab="fit" role="tab"><span class="tab-num">2</span> Find Your Fit</button>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 1: HOW TO MEASURE -->
    <div class="tab-panel active" id="panel-measure">
      <div class="measure-steps">

        <!-- Step A -->
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="illus">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0798/8055/2781/files/Width_mask_sizing.png?v=1772082872" alt="Measure eye width" width="280" height="280" style="max-width:280px;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;" />
          </div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3><span class="measure-num">A</span> Eye Width</h3>
            <p class="desc">Measure from the <strong>outer corner of one eye</strong> to the <strong>outer corner of the other</strong> in a straight line. Use a ruler, soft tape, or even a phone charger cable (then measure the cable against a ruler). Keep it flat against your face.</p>
            <div class="inline-input">
              <label for="inW">My measurement:</label>
              <input type="number" class="num-input" id="inW" placeholder="—" step="0.05" min="0" />
              <span class="unit-label" data-unit="w">in</span>
              <button class="unit-flip" data-target="w">Switch to cm</button>
              <span class="input-check" id="checkW">✓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step B -->
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="illus">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0798/8055/2781/files/Height_mask_sizing.png?v=1772082873" alt="Measure mask height" width="280" height="280" style="max-width:280px;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;" />
          </div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3><span class="measure-num">B</span> Mask Height</h3>
            <p class="desc">Measure from <strong>just above your eyebrow line</strong> straight down to <strong>just below your nose</strong>. Use a ruler, soft tape, or phone charger cable. This is the vertical space where the mask and silicone skirt will sit.</p>
            <div class="inline-input">
              <label for="inH">My measurement:</label>
              <input type="number" class="num-input" id="inH" placeholder="—" step="0.05" min="0" />
              <span class="unit-label" data-unit="h">in</span>
              <button class="unit-flip" data-target="h">Switch to cm</button>
              <span class="input-check" id="checkH">✓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step C -->
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="illus">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0798/8055/2781/files/measure_your_head_for_prescription_scuba_mask.webp?v=1760530768" alt="Measure head circumference" width="280" height="280" style="max-width:280px;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;" />
          </div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3><span class="measure-num">C</span> Head Circumference</h3>
            <p class="desc">Wrap a soft tape, string, or phone charger cable around your head <strong>above your ears and eyebrows</strong>, like measuring for a hat. Then measure the length against a ruler. This tells us how the strap and silicone skirt will seal around your face.</p>
            <div class="inline-input">
              <label for="inHead">My measurement:</label>
              <input type="number" class="num-input" id="inHead" placeholder="—" step="0.125" min="0" />
              <span class="unit-label" data-unit="head">in</span>
              <button class="unit-flip" data-target="head">Switch to cm</button>
              <span class="input-check" id="checkHead">✓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step D -->
        <div class="m-step">
          <div class="illus">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0798/8055/2781/files/which_nose_size_are_you_for_your_Rx_snorkel_Mask.png?v=1772082873" alt="Nose pocket sizing" width="280" height="280" style="max-width:280px;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;display:block;margin:0 auto;" />
          </div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3><span class="measure-num">D</span> Nose Size</h3>
            <p class="desc">Some masks have a narrower nose pocket. Selecting your nose size helps us rule out masks that may dig in or feel uncomfortable. If you're unsure, <strong>Medium</strong> is a safe choice.</p>
            <div class="nose-options" id="nosePickMeasure" style="margin-top:10px;">
              <button class="nose-opt" data-nose="small" type="button">Small <span class="nose-opt-check">✓</span></button>
              <button class="nose-opt" data-nose="medium" type="button">Medium <span class="nose-opt-check">✓</span></button>
              <button class="nose-opt" data-nose="large" type="button">Large <span class="nose-opt-check">✓</span></button>
            </div>
            <span class="input-check" id="checkNose" style="margin-top:8px;">✓</span>
          </div>
